<title>HONG KONG: Vanda interim profit surges 22 percent.</title>
<headline>Vanda interim profit surges 22 percent.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-12-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months ended September 30</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	   10.21  vs 10.19</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)    3.0    vs 3.0</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	  nil    vs nil</p>
<p>    Net			    22.06  vs 18.07</p>
<p>    Turnover		     406.46 vs 277.23</p>
<p>    Company name		 Vanda Systems &amp; Communications</p>
<p>				     Holdings Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		  January 20-24</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	   February 1</p>
<p>NOTE - Vanda Systems is a computer system integrator and distributor of personal computers in China. It was listed on the Stock Exchange on April 18, 1995.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
